令
$$
u=\frac{y^2}{x},\qquad z=yf(u).
$$
由链式法则，
$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial z}{\partial x}
&=yf'(u)\left(-\frac{y^2}{x^2}\right)\\
&=-\frac{y^3}{x^2}f'(u),
\end{aligned}
$$
$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial z}{\partial y}
&=f(u)+yf'(u)\frac{2y}{x}\\
&=f(u)+\frac{2y^2}{x}f'(u).
\end{aligned}
$$
分别乘 $2x$ 和 $y$，得
$$
2x\frac{\partial z}{\partial x}
=-\frac{2y^3}{x}f'(u),
$$
$$
y\frac{\partial z}{\partial y}
=yf(u)+\frac{2y^3}{x}f'(u).
$$
两式相加，含 $f'(u)$ 的项抵消，故
$$
\begin{aligned}
2x\frac{\partial z}{\partial x}
+y\frac{\partial z}{\partial y}
&=yf(u)\\
&=yf\left(\frac{y^2}{x}\right).
\end{aligned}
$$。 最终答案：$$
yf\left(\frac{y^2}{x}\right).
$$

令 $u=\sin y-\sin x$。由链式法则，
$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial z}{\partial x}
&=f'(u)(-\cos x)+y,\\
\frac{\partial z}{\partial y}
&=f'(u)\cos y+x.
\end{aligned}
$$
分别除以 $\cos x$ 和 $\cos y$，得
$$
\frac1{\cos x}\frac{\partial z}{\partial x}
=-f'(u)+\frac y{\cos x},
$$
$$
\frac1{\cos y}\frac{\partial z}{\partial y}
=f'(u)+\frac x{\cos y}.
$$
两式相加，含 $f'(u)$ 的项抵消，故
$$
\frac1{\cos x}\frac{\partial z}{\partial x}
+\frac1{\cos y}\frac{\partial z}{\partial y}
=\frac y{\cos x}+\frac x{\cos y}.
$$。 最终答案：$$
\frac{y}{\cos x}+\frac{x}{\cos y}.
$$

